    admin-toggle-overridden,warning,app/Models/Order.php,ask-user,"resolvePackingMode() now ignores the per-group admin toggle wherever isPackingOptionAvailable() is true. With the fee configured, that covers every order with more than one item, so in practice the admin checkbox stops doing anything. Concrete case: support has opted a pilot group in, and the customer never touches the new choice (pack_separately defaults false). The order completes packed together, the opposite of the opt-in. Support can also no longer turn the option on without the fee. This is deliberat… (truncated, 917 chars total)"
    invoice-fee-row-unverified,warning,src/Billing/InvoiceExporter.php,ask-user,"The exporter now prices the new taxable fee line as if the invoicing service bills it like shipping (one unit, net plus VAT). The docblock itself says no real invoice has shown it yet. If the service maps a taxable fee line differently, for example untaxed or at another VAT rate, the exact-total guarantee breaks silently for every packed order: the invoice total differs from the total the customer authorized. The vendor has confirmed the completion trigger, not the fee-line mapping. Confirmin… (truncated, 700 chars total)"
